* {{enPR|ĕn-vĕlʹəp}}, {{IPA|/ɛnˈvɛləp/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-envelop.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-uk-envelop.ogg|Audio (UK)|lang=en}}

